    "REPLAY_PARITY_REVOKES in the rule, which checks the TERMINAL state of an ordered",
    "replay - so deleting 0418 turns them straight back into fresh violations. Their",
    "0335 keys stay grandfathered on purpose: the next re-definition of those",
    "functions would re-run ALTER DEFAULT PRIVILEGES and reopen what 0418 closed, so",
